  "scope": "New bounded freestanding C framing/parser and plaintext assembler adapted from older primary aasdk framing behavior, not an official Google wire specification or current Pixel compatibility proof. Public example certificates/keys not copied or used. Buffers caller-owned, no crypto/decryption, automatic outbound fragmentation, TLS/channel/UI/device install or real USB. Unknown flags rejected under pinned-model policy; stricter plaintext ordering/length validation than upstream."
